        "recommendation": "Focus stays on the combobox while `aria-activedescendant` moves, so the browser draws no focus ring on the highlighted option: a sighted keyboard user sees which size ArrowDown/ArrowUp reached only through the `option--active` style. No stylesheet in the repository defines `.size-picker`, `.option` or `.option--active`. Check, where the styles live, that `option--active` gives a visible indication with at least 3:1 contrast (WCAG 2.4.7 Focus Visible, 1.4.11 Non-text Contrast), that the combobox keeps a visible focus indicator, and, if the list can scroll, that the highlighted option is scrolled into view.",
